Your career is about what you want to be and who you want to be. It’s about bringing your skills, curiosity and best true self to work.

By being part of this team, you will work from Monday to Friday, 09:00-18:00, in a hybrid way from Bucharest/ Brasov.

*We are primarily looking for candidates based in and willing to work from Bucharest or Brasov, while remaining open to a remote setup for candidates whose professional experience and language level are a match to role requirements.

How you’ll make an impact:
- Manage and update HR databases with different information such as new hires, terminations, personal and job data changes or leave of absence;

- Collect information from other departments or notify other departments of information relevant to their processes;

- Some roles may require a voice/contact center component to answer questions from employees related to HR requests;

- Collect, verify, organize or update company personnel records and documentation;

- Provide administrative support to employees, responding to inquiries via chat and ticketing systems (ServiceNow);

- Create HR documents such as reference letters;

- Work with other internal or client teams to execute HR processes;

- Capture new knowledge in the internal database and update process documentation as needed.

